\par\par \b \uc2 U.S. calls Switzerland, Vietnam  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  manipulators in Trump trade shot\b0\par\par\uc2 986 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 2020\par 07:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 WASHINGTON (Reuters) - The Trump administration labeled Switzerland and Vietnam \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulators on Wednesday, in another parting shot at trading partners that could complicate matters for U.S. President-elect \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 's incoming team.\par \par \uc2 In a long-overdue report, the \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  also added India, Thailand and Taiwan to a list of trading partners it says may be deliberately devaluing their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The COVID-19 pandemic has skewed trade flows and widened U.S. deficits with trading partners, an irritant to outgoing President \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2 , who won office four years ago partly on a promise to close the U.S. trade gap.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  said it does not manipulate its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and "remains willing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more strongly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market".\par \par \uc2 Vietnam's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would work with U.S. authorities to ensure a "harmonious and fair" trade relationship.\par \par \uc2 "Vietnam's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate policy has for years been managed in a way to contain inflation, ensure macro stability and not to create unfair trade advantage," the \uc2 State Bank of Vietnam\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The manipulator labels will ramp up pressure on Biden before he takes over, Per Hammered, chief emerging markets strategist at SEB in Stockholm, said.\par \par \uc2 "You set the agenda and force him (Biden) into positions that he will have to get out of somehow," Hammered said.\par \par \uc2 A \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  official said Biden's transition team had not been briefed, adding: "They are not implicated in this."\par \par \uc2 U.S. Treasury Secretary nominee \uc2 Janet Yellen\uc2  could alter the findings in her first \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report, which is due in April.\par \par \uc2 A spokesman for Biden's team did not respond to a request for comment.\par \par \uc2 The President-elect's team has been critical of other moves by U.S. Treasury Secretary \uc2 Steven Mnuchin\uc2 , including ending some \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  pandemic lending programs.\par \par \uc2 Mnuchin said in a statement that the Treasury "has taken a strong step today to safeguard economic growth and opportunity for American workers and businesses."\par \par \uc2 China, labeled by Mnuchin as a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulator in August 2019 at the height of trade tensions, was kept on the Treasury's monitoring list due to its high trade surplus with the United States.\par \par \uc2 Mnuchin lifted the designation in January, two days before the world's two largest economies signed a "Phase 1" trade deal.\par \par \uc2 TRADE ADVANTAGE\par \par \uc2 Countries must at least have a $20 billion-plus bilateral trade surplus with the United States, foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeding 2% of gross domestic product and a global current account surplus exceeding 2% of GDP to be labeled a manipulator.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam and Switzerland far exceeded these criteria, with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  of 5% and 14% of GDP respectively. (See FACTBOX)\par \par \uc2 The report said that at least part of Vietnam's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was aimed at pushing down the dong for a trade advantage, while at least part of Switzerland's action was aimed at pushing down the Swiss franc to prevent effective balance of payments adjustments.\par \par \uc2 Mark Sobel, a former Treasury and \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  (\uc2 IMF\uc2 ) official, said the manipulator designations were "mechanistic" interpretations of the thresholds that ignored subtleties and extenuating circumstances.\par \par \uc2 These include safe-haven inflows into Switzerland's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  due to the pandemic and a rush of foreign investment into Vietnam in 2019, fueled by U.S. tariffs on Chinese goods.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  has forecast that Vietnam's current account surplus will fall below the 2% of GDP threshold for 2020.\par \par \uc2 "They're missing some more obvious cases of harmful \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  practices," said Sobel, adding that Taiwan and \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which narrowly missed the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  thresholds, "have been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily for years."\par \par \uc2 The Treasury official said the United States will seek negotiations with Switzerland and Vietnam to bring them back below the manipulation thresholds and declined to speculate on whether the process could lead to U.S. tariffs on their goods.\par \par \uc2 Among remedies specified in U.S. laws governing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report are limiting offending countries' access to government procurement contracts and to development finance.\par \par \uc2 Vietnam could be hit with tariffs under a separate probe by the U.S. Trade Representative's office into the causes of an undervalued dong that could be influenced by the Treasury report. Some business leaders fear Trump could act before a late December hearing on the issue, but a source familiar with the matter said that appeared unlikely.\par \par \uc2 Taiwan said its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies were aimed at stability and that it hopes to cut its trade surplus with the United States to address U.S. concerns.\par \par \uc2 Thailand said its addition to the monitoring list would have no big impact.\par \par \uc2 The label briefly lifted the value of the Swiss franc against a broadly soft dollar.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategists said the move may make it slightly more difficult for the SNB to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but the easing of the coronavirus pandemic would reduce upward pressure on the franc.\par \par \uc2 The Thai baht leapt to a seven-year peak as investors reckoned \uc2 Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might ease off its baht selling. The dong inched up to a two-week high and the Taiwan dollar made a new 23-year peak. [EMRG/FRX]\par \par \uc2 The additions of India, Thailand and Taiwan leave the Treasury monitoring list at 10, with China, Japan, South Korea, German, Italy, Singapore and Malaysia already on it. Vietnam and Switzerland were upgraded and Ireland was removed.\par \par \uc2 The report said that India and Singapore had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in an "asymmetric manner" but did not meet other requirements to warrant a manipulator label.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by David Lawder; Additional reporting by Andrea Shalal in Washington, Dan Burns in New York, John Revill in Zurich, Saikat Chatterjee in London, Khanh Vu and James Pearson in Hanoi and Shriya Ramakrishnan in Bengaluru; Editing by Sam Holmes, Stephen Coates and Richard Pullin) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-12-17T06:10:01.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020201216egcg00qgt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
