\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened \highlight\uc2  to slow baht volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 2020\par 13:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds confirmation from \uc2 Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and context in 2nd, 3rd and 7th paragraphs)\par \par \uc2 By Satawasin Staporncharnchai\par \par \uc2 BANGKOK, Dec 9 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow volatility in the baht so that it would not affect economic recovery.\par \par \uc2 Progress in developing coronavirus vaccines, news of economic recovery last month and a depreciating U.S. dollar had affected \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region, Assistant Governor Vachira Arromdee said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The baht was affected by external factors and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  came in to ensure that volatility did not impact economic adjustments, she said, adding that \uc2 the Bank of Thailand\uc2  would continue to closely monitor markets.\par \par \uc2 The baht strengthened to a one-year high, at 29 baht per U.S. dollar, early on Wednesday, before returning to around 30 baht later in the day.\par \par \uc2 Thai exporters on Tuesday called on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ensure that the baht did not appreciate beyond 30 baht per U.S. dollar, saying it would hurt competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 "It's speculative forces from foreign investors, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to come in," said Jitipol Puksamatanan, head of markets strategy at SCB Securities.\par \par \uc2 The Thai economy shrank 6.4% in the third quarter after a slump of 12.1% in the preceding quarter. "Exporters should see this is as a warning that the dollar could weaken," he said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last month also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to rein in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Satawasin Staporncharnchai and Chayut Setboonsarng, additional reporting by Anushka Trivedi; editing by Ed Davies, Larry King) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-12-9T13:01:35.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020201209egc901dm5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
