\par\par \b \uc2 EM ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Firm dollar hurts Asia  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 ; baht underperforms after \uc2 Thai c.bank\uc2  warning\b0\par\par\uc2 706 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 April 2016\par 06:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thai c.bank\f28 \uc2 \f2  says ready to act if baht affects economy\par     * Indonesia rupiah dips; BI seen keeping rate on hold\par     * Ringgit down; Malaysia's strong sukuk sale cuts losses\par \par  (Adds text, updates prices)\par     By Jongwoo Cheon\par     SINGAPORE, April 21 (Reuters) - Emerging Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par slid on Thursday as broad strength in the dollar prompted\par traders to book profits from their recent gains ahead of the\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's policy meeting.\par     Thailand's baht led regional losses after \f28 \uc2 \f2 the Bank\par of Thailand\f28 \uc2 \f2  on Wednesday said it is ready to act if the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's moves affect the economy. \par     The Indonesian rupiah eased ahead of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank\par Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's monetary policy decision later in the day. The\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is expected to keep its benchmark interest rate\par  on hold. \par     Malaysia's ringgit slumped on the dollar's broad\par strength. The greenback held firm against a basket of six\par major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , with the euro particularly weaker ahead of \f28 \uc2 \f2 the\par ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2 's meeting later in the day.\par     ECB President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Mario Draghi\f28 \uc2 \f2  is likely to drive home the case\par for ultra-loose monetary policy, hitting back after a barrage of\par criticism from German officials who dispute the bank's recipe\par for tackling the euro zone's economic malaise. \par     Emerging Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , however, recouped some of their\par earlier losses as regional equities stayed near 5-1/2-month\par highs after oil prices rallied over 4 percent overnight.\par     Easier monetary policies of major central banks including\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 the ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2  and the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  may continue to draw investors\par towards higher yields and support regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , analysts\par said.\par     "Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will rebound in the coming sessions on capital\par inflows backed by easier monetary policies of \f28 \uc2 \f2 the ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2  and the\par BOJ, unless the euro drops sharply (giving a broad lift to the\par dollar) after \f28 \uc2 \f2 the ECB\f28 \uc2 \f2  meeting," said Qi Gao, an emerging Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  strategist for Scotiabank in Hong Kong.\par     "But from May, emerging Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are likely to\par decline versus the dollar ahead of June FOMC and Brexit\par referendum on June 23," he said, referring to the U.S. Federal\par Open Market Committee and Britain's possible exit from the\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 European Union\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\par     \par     BAHT\par     The baht slumped as caution over possible \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Thailand\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  prompted traders to ease off on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ,\par which hit a one-month high on Wednesday.\par     Foreign investors were also net sellers in the Thai bond\par market in the previous five sessions.\par     Thailand's government bond prices slid.\par     \par     RINGGIT\par     The ringgit fell as investors booked profits from the\par best-performing emerging Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  so far this year on the\par dollar's strength.\par     The Malaysian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pared some of earlier losses as\par traders bought it around the session low of 3.8990 per dollar\par after the country's strong sale of Islamic bond.\par     Earlier, the government said it has successfully priced a\par $1.5 billion dual-tranche benchmark sukuk, which was\par oversubscribed by 4.2 times. \par     Most of the government bond prices rose.\par     \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR\par     Change on the day at 0330 GMT\par   \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                 Latest bid   Previous day  Pct Move\par   Japan yen                   109.70         109.85     +0.14\par   Sing dlr                    1.3440         1.3442     +0.01\par   Taiwan dlr                  32.277         32.248     -0.09\par   Korean won                 1132.89        1135.20     +0.20\par   Baht                         35.03          34.85     -0.52\par   Peso                        46.360         46.225     -0.29\par   Rupiah                       13175          13136     -0.30\par   Rupee                        66.32          66.22     -0.15\par   Ringgit                     3.8760         3.8690     -0.18\par   Yuan                        6.4773         6.4745     -0.04\par                                                              \par   Change so far in 2016                                      \par   \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                 Latest bid  End prev year  Pct Move\par   Japan yen                   109.70